OL,3,AThree Kyiv bridges hit during major
OL,4,ARussian missile attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian President Vladimir Putin had
OL,7,Fthreatened to retaliate for the attack
OL,8,Fon the Crimean Bridge, which the
OL,9,FKremlin built to link Russia and the
OL,10,Foccupied peninsula.
OL,12,FThe latest Russian strikes coincided
OL,13,Fwith a flurry of talks around the war,
OL,14,Fand came as the Kremlin pushed back
OL,15,Fagainst a US claim that Russia could be
OL,16,Fopen to Western-backed security
OL,17,Fguarantees for Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
